1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,004
Here's how to record a Microsoft Teams meeting. Three ways, no note taking.

2
00:00:05,354 --> 00:00:07,082
One: the Lynkk meeting bot.

3
00:00:07,032 --> 00:00:12,078
Paste your Teams link, or turn on calendar auto-join, and it joins the call for you.

4
00:00:12,528 --> 00:00:13,805
Two: the Mac app.

5
00:00:13,755 --> 00:00:18,208
When your Teams call starts, click Record on the card. Nothing joins the call.

6
00:00:18,658 --> 00:00:20,380
Three: the Chrome extension.

7
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:23,985
Open Teams in a tab and press Record. No bot here either.

8
00:00:24,435 --> 00:00:28,386
Every call becomes a note: a transcript in seventeen languages,

9
00:00:28,336 --> 00:00:31,290
and a Meeting Brief with decisions and action items.

10
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:34,622
Send the tasks to Jira from the note, when you're ready.

11
00:00:35,072 --> 00:00:37,985
Start free at lynkk.ai. Follow for more.
